WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:05.370
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie this will be
my Arrow Episode 3 video.

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.870
Another big green man crashed the party last
night so I’m scrambling to catch up.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:13.719
This was without a doubt the best Thea Queen
episode ever and the best Brother Sister Oliver

00:00:13.719 --> 00:00:14.719
Thea episode ever.

00:00:14.719 --> 00:00:18.720
I also saw a lot of you making Arrow A-Team
jokes just because of the way everything looked

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:29.680
in Corto Maltese.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.320
Careful for spoilers if you haven’t seen
it yet.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.700
Starting with Top 5 Moments.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.980
Number 5 - Felicity’s New Job

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:40.410
All I could think about when the episode picked
up in the Arrow Cave was she was wearing Atom

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:41.620
Colors, with the Red and Blue tones.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:46.070
It’s just a visual reminder that now her
attention is divided between Ray Palmer and

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:47.070
Team Arrow.

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:50.230
I’m really digging the Ray Palmer Felicity
energy so far.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.370
It seems like they’re mostly going to play
up the more comedic aspects of both those

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:54.370
characters.

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.880
Which is a very quick way to win me over.

00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:02.030
Her assistant Gerry Conway is named after
the writer that created Firestorm in the late

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.030
70s at DC Comics.

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:07.160
You could also view this as a teaser for Ray
Palmer and Felicity both crossing over with

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:10.229
The Flash show which is going to feature Firestorm.

00:01:10.229 --> 00:01:16.040
Geoff Johns announced that Ray Palmer would
possibly move to the Flash show full time

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.530
after season 3 of Arrow and be a regular character
there.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:33.400
But you can see it’s all a distraction so
that Ray Palmer can learn about OMAC.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:36.550
Which the show has pulled out of the comics.

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:42.200
It’s a huge deal, in case you didn’t read
the comics, OMAC was created by Maxwell Lord

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.200
and Checkmate.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.400
It’s a hyper intelligent Orbital Weapons
Platform and Spy Satellite that tracks all

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:53.960
the metahumans on the planet.

00:01:53.960 --> 00:02:09.849
Off in the distance I can almost hear a Flash
Star Labs crossover coming…

00:02:09.849 --> 00:02:18.080
In the comics, Ted Kord the Blue Beetle was
the character tied to that storyline, since

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:24.689
Arrow wasn’t allowed to use that character,
they’re substituting Queen Industries as

00:02:24.689 --> 00:02:31.200
the people who built it and Ray Palmer as
the person who uncovers the secret plot.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.299
Since they haven’t done Checkmate yet in
the Arrow Verse, I wonder if they’ll use

00:02:34.299 --> 00:02:35.756
the Amanda Waller character and ARGUS as the
people who secretly commissioned OMAC.

00:02:35.756 --> 00:02:38.769
Like Amanda Waller wants to track all metahumans
so she uses government funds to secretly create

00:02:38.769 --> 00:02:42.050
a weapon of mass destruction to spy on anyone
who has super powers.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.379
It’s a very huge teaser so I can’t wait
to see what Arrow does with it.

00:02:45.379 --> 00:02:48.299
And based on how eager to please Ray Palmer
is, I’m wondering if he spent billions of

00:02:48.299 --> 00:02:51.059
dollars to buy Queen Industries just to learn
about OMAC.

00:02:51.059 --> 00:02:54.110
Like yes he wants to be a nice guy, he’s
not a dirtbag.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:57.250
It’s just that he’s distracting Felicity
and everyone else with his generosity so that

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:59.689
he can solve the OMAC mystery.

00:02:59.689 --> 00:03:06.159
Just put a bookmark on that, there’s a lot
more there we can talk about.

00:03:06.159 --> 00:03:08.579
Number 4 - Diggle Versus Manhunter

00:03:08.579 --> 00:03:10.261
Mark Shaw, the ARGUS character he went down
to get turned out to be one of the villains.

00:03:10.261 --> 00:03:12.999
In the comics he’s a vigilante that joins
a secret organization fighting crime and goes

00:03:12.999 --> 00:03:14.569
a little nuts before Kate Spencer becomes
Manhunter.

00:03:14.569 --> 00:03:17.902
In the past Arrow has typically simplified
a lot of the crazier comic book things so

00:03:17.902 --> 00:03:18.902
they fit inside the crime drama type show
they’re doing.

00:03:18.902 --> 00:03:21.500
The Flash is the show that’s going extremely
comic book crazy powers.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:25.739
What a wonderful coincidence that everything
they want just happens to be hiding in Corto

00:03:25.739 --> 00:03:26.739
Maltese.

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:29.599
The island itself is very famous inside the
DC Universe.

00:03:29.599 --> 00:03:32.230
It’s totally fictitious, it’s a place
created inside the comics.

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:36.349
It’s a small South American country that
used to have ties to the Soviet Union.

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:40.439
Now it’s just a hiding place for people
like Malcolm Merlyn and warlords doing business.

00:03:40.439 --> 00:03:44.560
It first appeared in Frank Miller’s Dark
Knight Returns comic book.

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:49.569
They did mention it once on Smallville and
Arrow mentioned it once before in a Deadshot

00:03:49.569 --> 00:03:51.140
episode during season 1.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:55.329
The big twist, that secret data seemed like
a separate plot from the OMAC plot.

00:03:55.329 --> 00:03:59.939
I don’t know if Amanda Waller is behind
OMAC, but the people trying to get the ARGUS

00:03:59.939 --> 00:04:01.650
intel are still a mystery.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:05.599
I’m hoping that ARGUS data turns into a
bigger plot, it would be cool if they did

00:04:05.599 --> 00:04:07.200
more with HIVE on the show.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.889
They teased them back during Season 2 and
right now they’re the only other big shadow

00:04:10.889 --> 00:04:14.159
organization we know about aside from The
League of Assassins.

00:04:14.159 --> 00:04:17.980
So, just remember, someone big is out to destroy
ARGUS.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.530
Number 3 - Oliver and Thea Reunion

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:24.960
This was an amazing scene for both of them,
I just made this my number 3 because a few

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.700
other bigger things were also happening in
the episode.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.910
For the first two seasons Thea hasn’t been
much of a character.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:33.030
She’s really only existed inside of other
people’s stories.

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:36.190
Like you only see her when Oliver or Roy are
around.

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:39.370
So when Oliver explains that even though she
doesn’t need him, he needs her.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:43.450
It’s like the show is telling us she’s
being kicked up to the big office, just like

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:44.450
Felicity.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.780
The same thing was happening with Laurel,
all of the secondary female characters received

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:49.540
a huge promotion to A-List status.

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:56.900
Just from a meta standpoint, that’s a huge
deal and I’m really happy the producers

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.650
are doing that.

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:10.150
The brother sister moment is also an opportunity
to show Oliver is a real person.

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:14.500
I think he forgets that sometimes.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.650
Last year there was that sex scene he had
with Black Canary.

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:24.190
It was a brief moment, when you were seeing
him with his guard down and his pants.

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:26.860
Just him not wearing any masks.

00:05:26.860 --> 00:05:31.630
I still feel like he has to exert mental effort
to be the Arrow.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:44.540
It’s not like Batman where Bruce Wayne is
the mask and Batman is who he really is.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:56.490
Oliver is still in a limbo state where he’s
not in the public spotlight so much he has

00:05:56.490 --> 00:06:03.080
to create a Bruce Wayne type persona and he’s
not so dark that he’s got resting Arrow

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.080
Face.

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:05.580
That’s just what I’m calling resting bitch
face.

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:09.470
If you’ve never heard of resting bitch face
it’s just when someone’s relaxed face

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.700
makes them look like they’re pissed about
something.

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.830
Number 2 - Laurel Becomes a Vigilante

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.440
One of the best teasers ever.

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:18.330
Wildcat will train her to fight.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.750
Mostly street fight at first.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:20.860
Wildcat is a boxer.

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:39.360
Even in the comics, but Arrow as a show does
a lot of parkour, so I think her training

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:44.500
will branch out to more MMA type stuff.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.040
Just expect a crazy awesome training montage
scene.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:51.700
Oliver got all his training montage scenes.

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.250
Now it’s everyone else’s turn.

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:56.780
I’m so happy with the direction they’re
taking Laurel this year.

00:06:56.780 --> 00:07:02.490
They will be turning her into Black Canary
but I think they’ll take their time.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:03.930
She has a lot of training to do.

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:07.600
What I’m expecting to see is a version of
what Roy went through last year.

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:11.420
He spent about half the season evolving into
Arsenal, then got the costume in the finale

00:07:11.420 --> 00:07:16.090
and then spent the time in between seasons
becoming a full time side kick.

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:19.190
They address a lot of that in the Arrow Season
2.5 comic book.

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:22.480
It covers the five months or so between the
end of season 2 and the beginning of season

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.480
3.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:27.670
So if Laurel goes back to kick that dude’s
ass I think she’ll still have the black

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:28.670
mask.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:29.670
She’ll just be a better fighter.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.812
And then maybe by the season 3 finale she’ll
have a comic book-y black canary costume.

00:07:32.812 --> 00:07:33.812
There was a picture of her getting fitted
for a mask she posted.

00:07:33.812 --> 00:07:35.190
They wouldn’t make a face mold for that
ski mask she wore.

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:37.300
So this means her black canary costume will
have some sort of full face covering.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:40.000
I’m sure it will look totally badass, so
I can’t wait to see it.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.730
and my Number 1 moment - Thea Queen Becomes
a Badass

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:47.440
I’m going to think of her as an amalgam
of a couple comic book characters, she doesn’t

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.440
seem evil.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:53.580
So she’s not straight up Cheshire or Lady
Shiva, she does have the evil dad and she’s

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:57.310
a good archer so you could say there’s a
little Artemis in there but you could also

00:07:57.310 --> 00:08:01.070
say she’s got some Mia Dearden just because
her name is Thea Dearden Queen on the show.

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:05.400
So take your pick, Oliver has always called
her Speedy.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:09.919
But that doesn’t mean she’s joining team
Arrow as a plant for Malcolm Merlyn.

00:08:09.919 --> 00:08:14.230
I think it will be a divided loyalty situation
where Thea still loves Oliver and cares about

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:17.460
Roy, but she’s aligned herself with Malcom
Merlyn, who is their enemy.

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:19.950
So Thea will have a lot going on this year.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:23.850
What I’m most excited to see is Oliver and
Roy catching her in the act of doing something

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:24.850
crazy.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:27.550
They did that little tease at the airport
with her reflexes.

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:29.120
So Oliver knows something is up.

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:31.960
But I think it will be a while before they
learn what she’s really been doing.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:36.319
Thea will get her own secrets just like Oliver
has his.

00:08:36.319 --> 00:08:39.909
And yes, I do think she will be engaging in
nighttime ass kicking activities, apart from

00:08:39.909 --> 00:08:40.909
Oliver and Roy.

00:08:40.909 --> 00:08:44.149
I would hope that by the end of the season,
everybody learns everyone’s secrets and

00:08:44.149 --> 00:08:47.629
Thea is able to fight with Team Arrow and
Laurel for that matter.

00:08:47.629 --> 00:08:51.050
So much stuff happened, let me know what your
favorite moment was.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:55.240
While you think about that here were a couple
of funny things I noticed:

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:59.139
On Felicity’s computer monitor here, she
was reading an article about The Flash.

00:08:59.139 --> 00:09:02.449
Just a little tease about next week’s Flash
episode which she is guest starring on.

00:09:02.449 --> 00:09:04.440
That’s also the captain cold episode.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:09.750
When she first walked into the office Ray
Palmer said some wacko blew up Queen Industries

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.009
Applied Sciences Division.

00:09:11.009 --> 00:09:13.819
That was Felicity’s Idea during Season 2.

00:09:13.819 --> 00:09:18.499
They were trying to stop Slade from using
Applied Sciences to make more Mirakuru.

00:09:18.499 --> 00:09:19.930
She’s the wacko that blew it up.

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:22.930
So of course she responded with “I’m sure
they had a good reason”.

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:25.949
Oliver’s Improvised Bow and Arrows.

00:09:25.949 --> 00:09:28.649
Stephen Amell did a Q&amp;A video where he joked
about this.

00:09:28.649 --> 00:09:31.540
Definitely one of the funnier cut away montages.

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:35.309
Please more moments like this.

00:09:35.309 --> 00:09:38.319
Then the Flashback with Thea and Merlyn to
the beginning of her training.

00:09:38.319 --> 00:09:42.089
I laughed so hard when he said he didn’t
know how to train her, so he was just going

00:09:42.089 --> 00:09:43.910
to do it like it was done to him.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:49.110
That seems like a very awkward dad thing to
say.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:53.220
Like single dad trying to raise a girl.

00:09:53.220 --> 00:10:21.410
I have no idea what I’m doing, so I’m
just going to 

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:31.990
it the old school way.

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:33.220
For better or worse.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:35.660
And then just jumps at her.

